ね","ts":"1626955314.476300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BraWw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4f9dcb8-c54e-460b-b336-402890eb95da","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"投資は一般人向けにガッツリ特集組まれるようになったり\nご縁のないやつが始めだすと買い時は終わりって言われますねぇ","ts":"1626955135.475300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H5b0Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f7b2b32-cfce-4168-988b-83c9f3b723fc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"考えなおしていること自体はいいんだけど、ちょっと短絡的だよね...","ts":"1626955106.474800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z6TD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81a36728-da13-40c7-8933-2dbae31e522b","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"何もわからずに保険入りまくってるような人が投資って言い始めてるのを見ると、もう買ってはいけないんだな、という感じがする。","ts":"1626955033.473600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jYxf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3355a32-6346-4841-ae08-390389c0a0a3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちなみに、ある株Aとある株Bの両方をもってたけど、BがAに吸収合併されて、Bの株はAに変換されました(量はあまり多くない=株価の差)","ts":"1626954919.472700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"knS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f31a33f-a637-4a03-b9f4-d638124ce495","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"買った株式の企業がいつまで残るかなんてわからんからそうですよね・・・","ts":"1626954857.471700","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1626954882.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R63"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb8e5101-b358-4a40-b4d3-9f7333bc896c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ配当による利回りいいのを長期保持するのはそこまでは悪くはないとは思うけど\n投資信託とくらべるとリスク高いよなあ..というのはよく理解できた","ts":"1626954733.471100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o5r+g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"268ccc63-8c33-41c8-9882-2208a57a2614","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"今は値動き無茶苦茶だから株主優待とか配当狙いくらいしかできんよな","ts":"1626954616.469900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uox"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba9bfade-b16d-4389-a3bb-86b2244133aa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ある特定の株がド当りしているので、全体ではまあまあプラスなので損はしてないけど","ts":"1626954467.469200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7N/Zn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa89d0ae-975c-46a6-8955-64a78638e5a2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"正直株系は昨今のこともあり、若干のマイナスなので、やっぱ個人がやってもなあという思い","ts":"1626954442.468500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Glb7H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"326c8ed6-8bec-43ab-9caf-cd318660f634","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分はSBIで三井住友NLでの積み立てをやりはじめているので、今年末に積み立てに切り替え予定\n(いまNISAにあるのは特定口座に移動になるはず)","ts":"1626954418.467900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/yIin"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2546939-9a04-42ad-ae19-50cd6bc7dce3","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"一応口座作ったんだけどミニ株無いところって後で気付いて放置したままだなw","ts":"1626954311.467000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"79m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89e77827-6068-47cd-9280-340a161cb7a1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"つみたてNISA は 月5000円からいけますね","ts":"1626954254.466100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hFQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b22a262-6e9f-4f93-a8fa-f108259e055e","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"つみたてNISAは少額からでもできるやつだったかな・・・？","ts":"1626954152.465700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"